Description: remote control and EQ builder for RME ADI-2 DACs
 A GTK4 remote, parametric EQ builder and bit-perfect PipeWire setup for
 the RME ADI-2 DAC, ADI-2 Pro and ADI-2/4 Pro, using RME's published
 USB MIDI SysEx protocol.
 .
 It reads and writes every output, input and device parameter, draws a
 live 5-band EQ curve, imports Equalizer APO, REW, AutoEq and Squiglink
 EQ files, and keeps shareable local JSON profiles. It also works offline
 as a profile builder. The adi2-eq command turns a profile into SysEx.
 .
 This is independent software, not affiliated with or endorsed by RME.
